WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.293 --> 00:00:01.483
- Good morning, Believe Nation!

00:00:01.483 --> 00:00:04.705
Today's message is have an impact.

00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:06.788
Over to you, Chris Sacca.

00:00:09.666 --> 00:00:12.001
(rooster crows)

00:00:12.001 --> 00:00:14.516
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:14.516 --> 00:00:17.933
♫ Espresso keep me going

00:00:19.214 --> 00:00:20.669
- Too many investors
invest in the things that

00:00:20.669 --> 00:00:23.283
they just like and are comfortable with

00:00:23.283 --> 00:00:26.783
and are within their own
little bubble, and yet,

00:00:26.783 --> 00:00:28.299
I think the distinction we like to make is

00:00:28.299 --> 00:00:29.834
invest in things that we know we can

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:31.953
personally impact the outcome of.

00:00:31.953 --> 00:00:34.362
So everyone can be talking about the hot

00:00:34.362 --> 00:00:37.990
biotech deal and it might be
on the verge of curing cancer,

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:39.369
but I cannot do anything

00:00:39.369 --> 00:00:42.238
to advance the mission
of a biotech company.

00:00:42.238 --> 00:00:43.134
Quite literally.

00:00:43.134 --> 00:00:44.526
And so we passed.

00:00:44.526 --> 00:00:45.908
As cool as it may seem,

00:00:45.908 --> 00:00:46.741
if I'm going to mooch,

00:00:46.741 --> 00:00:48.656
I may as well mooch in
the public markets, right,

00:00:48.656 --> 00:00:51.337
and just throw darts and
ride the greens and reds.

00:00:51.337 --> 00:00:53.160
So if I believe that I can take something

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:54.664
that's already a good company

00:00:54.664 --> 00:00:57.751
and just make it a little
more likely to be a success,

00:00:57.751 --> 00:00:59.878
then that's a rigged game for me.

00:00:59.878 --> 00:01:01.385
It almost feels unfair, right?

00:01:01.385 --> 00:01:03.255
And I can be just that much more confident

00:01:03.255 --> 00:01:05.583
that the investors who
give me their money,

00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:06.624
I'm going to give them their

00:01:06.624 --> 00:01:08.625
money back and a lot more after that.

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:09.613
- So as an investor myself,

00:01:09.613 --> 00:01:10.824
it's something that I look at.

00:01:10.824 --> 00:01:12.423
I want to make sure that
I'm invested into businesses

00:01:12.423 --> 00:01:14.176
that I believe in,

00:01:14.176 --> 00:01:15.581
that I can add something to,

00:01:15.581 --> 00:01:16.893
that I can inject some creativity

00:01:16.893 --> 00:01:19.284
and leverage what I've done

00:01:19.284 --> 00:01:22.010
with my audience and
YouTube and my website,

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:24.937
and not just invest in somebody

00:01:24.937 --> 00:01:26.657
'cause their thing looks cool,

00:01:26.657 --> 00:01:28.183
but I think the more valuable message

00:01:28.183 --> 00:01:30.463
to you guys who are probably more

00:01:30.463 --> 00:01:31.432
in the entrepreneurial side

00:01:31.432 --> 00:01:32.415
than the investor side

00:01:32.415 --> 00:01:34.209
is you need to apply the same kind

00:01:34.209 --> 00:01:36.240
of thinking when you're
looking for investors.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:37.528
So when you are going out

00:01:37.528 --> 00:01:39.085
looking for someone to give you money

00:01:39.085 --> 00:01:40.304
to launch your business,

00:01:40.304 --> 00:01:41.767
expand your business,

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:42.664
especially when you're dealing

00:01:42.664 --> 00:01:44.471
with angel investors
or venture capitalists,

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:48.071
you want the people who can
give you more than just money.

00:01:48.071 --> 00:01:50.352
It may be great to think about your

00:01:50.352 --> 00:01:53.145
uncle Joe or aunt Jill or whoever it is,

00:01:53.145 --> 00:01:55.014
you know, the dentist down the street

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.280
or the doctor that you know

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:59.130
or that lawyer friend of
yours to give you money.

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:01.480
Which you don't want
what's called dumb money.

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:03.652
You don't want people
to just give you money

00:02:03.652 --> 00:02:04.678
and that's it,

00:02:04.678 --> 00:02:06.909
because your biggest
thing is not just money.

00:02:06.909 --> 00:02:09.318
You want somebody who
cares about your business,

00:02:09.318 --> 00:02:11.796
who doesn't see it only as an investment,

00:02:11.796 --> 00:02:14.391
who cares about the
mission that you're on,

00:02:14.391 --> 00:02:15.604
and that can open doors for you.

00:02:15.604 --> 00:02:17.119
That can give guidance to you.

00:02:17.119 --> 00:02:19.447
Right, you want somebody who
you can ask questions to,

00:02:19.447 --> 00:02:21.166
and they can give you some mentorship.

00:02:21.166 --> 00:02:23.701
You want somebody who's going
to open up their rolodex

00:02:23.701 --> 00:02:25.370
of contacts and make introductions

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:27.054
for you to help you close new deals,

00:02:27.054 --> 00:02:28.254
to help you get more media,

00:02:28.254 --> 00:02:29.839
to help you get new suppliers,

00:02:29.839 --> 00:02:31.918
and get more customers on board.

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:33.038
And so I'd highly, highly, highly

00:02:33.038 --> 00:02:34.047
encourage you,

00:02:34.047 --> 00:02:35.151
anybody who's out there trying

00:02:35.151 --> 00:02:36.792
to raise money for their business,

00:02:36.792 --> 00:02:41.218
don't bring on any investor
just because you need money.

00:02:41.218 --> 00:02:44.033
You have to get the
right investor on board.

00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:45.827
And that's hard to do.

00:02:45.827 --> 00:02:46.660
Because when you're struggling

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:47.737
and you really need that cash

00:02:47.737 --> 00:02:49.234
and it's really hurting your growth,

00:02:49.234 --> 00:02:50.067
the tendency is,

00:02:50.067 --> 00:02:52.685
I'll take anybody because I
want to ramp up my growth.

00:02:52.685 --> 00:02:55.106
But you're making a long-term

00:02:55.106 --> 00:02:57.699
decision based on short-term needs.

00:02:57.699 --> 00:02:58.651
And the last thing you want to do

00:02:58.651 --> 00:03:00.875
is get stuck with an investor

00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:03.308
who isn't going to be a
fit for you long-term.

00:03:03.308 --> 00:03:04.642
Right, they're going to always own

00:03:04.642 --> 00:03:05.990
a piece of your company

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.127
and the more and more people

00:03:07.127 --> 00:03:08.806
that own a chunk of your business,

00:03:08.806 --> 00:03:10.239
that don't actually contribute

00:03:10.239 --> 00:03:11.877
anything besides money to you,

00:03:11.877 --> 00:03:14.279
you don't want those guys
on your company at all.

00:03:14.279 --> 00:03:15.655
So the question of the day today is

00:03:15.655 --> 00:03:17.565
we haven't talked a lot about investing,

00:03:17.565 --> 00:03:19.870
investments, getting
investors into your company,

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:20.938
I'm curious for you guys,

00:03:20.938 --> 00:03:23.452
are you looking at angel investments?

00:03:23.452 --> 00:03:25.524
Have you already gone
down that route or not?

00:03:25.524 --> 00:03:26.701
Where are you on your path?

00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:27.910
Are you going to self-fund it?

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:28.743
Try to get investments?

00:03:28.743 --> 00:03:29.576
Try to get loans?

00:03:29.576 --> 00:03:30.705
Where are you on your path

00:03:30.705 --> 00:03:32.295
of raising capital?

00:03:32.295 --> 00:03:33.368
I'm curious to find out,

00:03:33.368 --> 00:03:34.953
leave it in the comments below.

00:03:34.953 --> 00:03:37.553
I also want to give a quick
shout-out to Andrew Bierkamp.

00:03:37.553 --> 00:03:38.878
Andrew, thank you so much

00:03:38.878 --> 00:03:41.305
for picking up a copy of
my book, Your One Word,

00:03:41.305 --> 00:03:42.582
it really really really really

00:03:42.582 --> 00:03:43.470
means a lot to me,

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:44.913
and I hope you enjoy it.

00:03:44.913 --> 00:03:46.262
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:03:46.262 --> 00:03:48.136
I hope you have an amazing day.

00:03:48.136 --> 00:03:49.064
I believe in you

00:03:49.064 --> 00:03:51.623
and hope you continue
to believe in yourself

00:03:51.623 --> 00:03:53.704
and whatever your one word is.

00:03:53.704 --> 00:03:56.374
Much love, and I'll see
